{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓星宋慧喬夥拍孔劉合作的新劇《夢響年代》，將於下月11日上架，兩人合體亮相「國民MC」劉在石主持的網絡節目，透露彼此都是A血型，MBTI同樣是INFJ，因此十分老友。</p><p>宋慧喬自認是急性子，還大爆孔劉約吃飯每次都轉彎抹角，令人很不耐煩。</p><p>宋慧喬表</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T07:16:47.921609+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T06:56:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T07:10:35.818892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T07:10:35.818892+00:00","content_hash":"fb3d8094c5aee8b778de055bf24bba08179445749452042e4560118ad87ddcb9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}